    "sections": {
        "description": "<ul>\n<li>Virtual endpoints: /llm.txt and /llms.txt.</li>\n<li>Modes: Allow All, Per-Bot toggles, or Manual override.</li>\n<li>Advanced Generator: policy-first block, homepage summary (meta/paragraph), per-page titles/descriptions, sitemap support, preview + copy.</li>\n<li>Live checker confirms endpoints return text/plain 200 OK.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload and activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> LLMs TXT Manager.</li>\n<li>Configure on <strong>Settings / Basic</strong>; generate drafts on <strong>Advanced</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20is%20llm.txt%3F'>\nWhat is llm.txt?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The llm.txt (and llms.txt) file guides AI/LLM crawlers.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.5.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Switched slug and text domain to <code>msg-llms-txt-manager</code>. Admin page slug &amp; enqueue handle updated.</li>\n<li>Kept unique prefix <code>msgltm_</code> for options, actions, transients, and class names.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create /llm.txt and /llms.txt in Allow All, Per-Bot or Manual modes with live checker and an advanced generator.",
    "description": "<ul>\n<li>Virtual endpoints: /llm.txt and /llms.txt.</li>\n<li>Modes: Allow All, Per-Bot toggles, or Manual override.</li>\n<li>Advanced Generator: policy-first block, homepage summary (meta/paragraph), per-page titles/descriptions, sitemap support, preview + copy.</li>\n<li>Live checker confirms endpoints return text/plain 200 OK.</li>\n</ul>\n",
